      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782461321276,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Concepts in the project:\n\n    - PySpark Structured Streaming\n    - Unpacking and Regular Expressions\n    - UDF - User defined function\n    - Take advantage of Pyspark Microbatch\n    - Branching Logic & The Vectorized Pandas API\n    - Delta table - Delta lake\n   ",
